config ADC_TLSR8258
	bool "Telink TLSR8258 ADC driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_TELINK_TLSR8258_ADC_ENABLED
	select ADC_CONFIGURABLE_INPUTS
	help
	  Enable the on-chip SAR ADC of the TLSR8258. Each channel samples one
	  GPIO (PB0..PB7, PC4, PC5) either as a base-mode input or in VBAT mode.
